OL,3,GNEWSAHow rail chiefs hope to make line
OL,4,Amore reliable after 'appalling' summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor passengers travelling on South
OL,7,FWestern Rail (SWR) across the
OL,8,Fsouth-west of England, this summer's
OL,9,Fextreme weather has caused major delays
OL,10,Fand disruption.
OL,12,FSWR's popular service between Exeter in
OL,13,FDevon and London, which thousands of
OL,14,Fpeople use every day, has been cut to
OL,15,Ftwo-hourly rather than every hour amid
OL,16,Fthe track becoming unstable in hot, dry
OL,17,Fweather.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
