OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1788002741
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAHow rail chiefs hope to make line
OL,4,Amore reliable after 'appalling' summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service, which runs through
OL,7,FSomerset and Wiltshire, has also been
OL,8,Fforced to run at reduced speeds. This
OL,9,Fhas caused some long delays to
OL,10,Fjourneys.
OL,12,FSalisbury to Exeter Rail User Group
OL,13,F(SERUG) said the line's "timekeeping
OL,14,Fhas been appalling" over the last six
OL,15,Fweeks, with a survey revealing 90% of
OL,16,Ftrains were arriving late at Crewkerne
OL,17,Fin Somerset in July.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
